A||N||1||Ga fiero fan||Lowering my 85 GT||||1||
Z||000000||Ga fiero fan||04-21-2001||01:48 PM||||Hey fiero fans what other ways can i drop my ride an inch or 2 besides using eibach springs. Would like suggestions on diffrent companies and prices or is eibach the best way to go.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||04-21-2001||02:43 PM||||Street Dreams has lowered spindles for the front and there are a few companies selling adjustable coil-overs for the rear struts. <BR>Going that route will keep the ride of the car close to normal. Using the Eibachs will stiffen the ride a lot. I used Eibachs and it is very stiff. I also used poly bushings and KPB shocks/struts.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 04-21-2001).]||||reg||1
